# TRAIL, ACYCLIC and SIMPLE restrict nothing further: every path here already visits no vertex twice. They used to
# keep the pattern off the artifact routes, and ONE ROW PER with a mode on an unnamed pattern failed to find its
# quantified element. A seed given as a scalar subquery reaches the traversal (it used to search from every vertex).
query III
